{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026a5LsRAOMYw1792971679.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>塞爾維亞議會選舉投選率創新高，點票工作尚未完結，競逐總理的前總統武契奇已承認落敗。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SERB.ELEX-0730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026KrScoZunWI1792971688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>塞爾維亞議會選舉採用比例代表制，決定250個議席誰屬。武契奇在他的塞爾維亞前進黨集會上承認落敗，指根據推算，對手「學生名單」將取得135至140個國會議席，而塞爾維亞前進黨只會取得大約105席。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.SERB.ELEX-0730.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gek4RwbKMD1792971700.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>武契奇宣布落敗後，首都貝爾格萊德有大批「學生名單」支持者上街慶祝。「學生名單」由學生團體推動，名單由大學教授，演員、農民等候選人組成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:24.505500+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":207,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T23:58:08.919265+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T05:18:11.568708+00:00","content_hash":"213375b29a3e820bf125372e6e016dc61381fa3b78efc6e8bffce212ffc38ebf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T05:22:24.505500+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}